@startuml
[*] --> Greeting
Greeting --> PINCheck : InsertCardEvent
PINCheck --> IncorrectPin : WrongPinEnteredEvent
IncorrectPin --> TryAgain : UserInputEvent
TryAgain --> PINCheck : CorrectPinEnteredEvent
PINCheck --> MainMenu : PinCorrectEvent
MainMenu --> TransactionProcessing : UserSelectionEvent
TransactionProcessing --> CardRetained : SecurityPrecautionEvent
CardRetained --> CardReturned : UserCancellationEvent
CardRetained --> SessionEnded : OperationCompletionEvent
SessionEnded --> [*]
CardReturned --> [*]
Greeting --> CardInserted : CardInsertionEvent
@enduml
